2026-09-05 --:--  [v4-core]  v3->v4 constant rename with no migration note found.
    Expected v3's MIN_SQRT_RATIO/MAX_SQRT_RATIO in v4's TickMath. They are MIN_SQRT_PRICE and
    MAX_SQRT_PRICE. Values and tick range are identical, so v4's TickMath is safe to point at a v3
    pool -- which is exactly what this project does, since v3's own libraries are pinned to =0.7.6
    and cannot be compiled alongside it. Had to diff the constants by hand to establish that it
    was a rename and not a semantic change. A one-line note in either repo would have covered it.
    (cost: ~10m)

2026-09-05 --:--  [tooling]  adding v4-core silently repointed an existing remapping.
